WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.504
SimpleLocalize manages keyed
catalogs in a hosted editor,

2
00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.568
and a GitHub App or
CLI syncs the files.

3
00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.726
General Translation translates
copy in your components,

4
00:00:11.726 --> 00:00:13.710
in your build, without keys.

5
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:19.724
Its AI auto-translation uses key
descriptions and screenshots,

6
00:00:19.724 --> 00:00:23.671
and it hosts translations on
a CDN with mobile updates.

7
00:00:24.071 --> 00:00:27.007
Plans count translation
keys and team members.

8
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.322
With General Translation,

9
00:00:29.322 --> 00:00:31.725
copy stays in &lt;T&gt; or your files,

10
00:00:31.725 --> 00:00:33.593
and translation runs in your build.

11
00:00:33.993 --> 00:00:38.126
Context comes from JSX
structure and Context Groups,

12
00:00:38.126 --> 00:00:40.656
and reviewers join
without seat fees.

13
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.831
Your team now ships
French with each release.
